{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01UXgkcg94isFk81EjFBLwcv","type":"tool_result","content":"# Farmers Markets Count Analysis\n\nBased on the data provided, here's what I found:\n\n**Territories (excluded from the 50-state total):**\n- Puerto Rico: 2 farmers markets\n- Virgin Islands: 0 farmers markets\n- District of Columbia: 54 farmers markets\n\n**Total for 50 US States Only:**\n\nSumming the farmers_markets column for all states (excluding DC, Puerto Rico, and Virgin Islands): **10,062 farmers markets**\n\nThis total represents agricultural retail venues across the continental United States, Alaska, and Hawaii, providing communities with direct access to locally-sourced produce and farm products."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"cb773b02-1e24-4f48-a8c3-3d84f361eb59","uuid":"2f68b533-ce27-40ba-b13e-72de9d865739","timestamp":"2026-08-16T20:09:09.996Z","tool_use_result":{"bytes":2651,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"# Farmers Markets Count Analysis\n\nBased on the data provided, here's what I found:\n\n**Territories (excluded from the 50-state total):**\n- Puerto Rico: 2 farmers markets\n- Virgin Islands: 0 farmers markets\n- District of Columbia: 54 farmers markets\n\n**Total for 50 US States Only:**\n\nSumming the farmers_markets column for all states (excluding DC, Puerto Rico, and Virgin Islands): **10,062 farmers markets**\n\nThis total represents agricultural retail venues across the continental United States, Alaska, and Hawaii, providing communities with direct access to locally-sourced produce and farm products.","durationMs":3424,"url":"https://harvestlymarkets.com/data/us-farmers-markets-by-state-2026.csv"}}
